{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"kenneth-mitchell","name":"Kenneth Mitchell","birthDate":"1974-11-25","birthPlace":"Toronto, Ontario, Canada","bio":"Kenneth Mitchell (November 25, 1974 – February 24, 2024) was a Canadian actor, best known for playing several Klingon characters in Star Trek: Discovery. He also had a role on the television series Jericho, starred in the 2004 sports biopic Miracle, and played Captain Marvel’s father in the 2019 film.\n\nMitchell was married to actress Susan May Pratt and had two children.\n\nMitchell died at the age of 49 from complications with amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS).","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:47:39+00:00","tmdbId":28868,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/28868","credits":[{"id":"captain-marvel","title":"Captain Marvel","character":"Joseph Danvers","characterFa":"جوزف دانورز"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/kenneth-mitchell.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Old Man","year":2022,"character":"Joe","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8Ec9zCZl2Go8WhDN1JWjjgQRlEi.jpg"},{"name":"Star Trek: Lower Decks","year":2020,"character":"Black Ops Officer 2 / Romulan Guard 1 / Tweerk Captain (voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i7Em3r7KCyNfkOwMkyqN8UMvK8S.jpg"},{"name":"Captain Marvel","year":2019,"character":"Joseph Danvers","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AtsgWhDnHTq68L0lLsUrCnM7TjG.jpg","characterFa":"جوزف دانورز"},{"name":"Nancy Drew","year":2019,"character":"Joshua Dodd","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cBXeSqUE4reXkGvs3lUls8M9J72.jpg"},{"name":"See","year":2019,"character":"Edo","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lKDIhc9FQibDiBQ57n3ELfZCyZg.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Honey","year":2017,"character":"Neil Heath","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ppApCGPCSlC9aYgTXerPeBReE3U.jpg"},{"name":"Star Trek: Discovery","year":2017,"character":"Kol","mediaType"